sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Browser (React 18)
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Router
    participant Middleware as Correlation & Security Middleware
    participant Auth as AuthService & RBAC
    participant ChatSvc as ChatService & QueryRouter
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB Vector Store
    participant Rerank as Hybrid Reranker
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini 1.5/Flash Lite
    participant Audit as AuditRepository
    participant DB as Relational Database (SQLAlchemy)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/chat (Authorization: Bearer <JWT>)
    Gateway->>Middleware: Intercept & Attach X-Request-ID
    Middleware->>Auth: Validate JWT & Extract Claims (user_id, role)
    Auth-->>Gateway: Principal Validated (Student STU_2024_015)
    Gateway->>ChatSvc: process_chat_query(request, user)
    
    ChatSvc->>ChatSvc: Classify Intent (Institutional RAG Query)
    ChatSvc->>Chroma: query(query_text, n_results=15)
    Chroma-->>ChatSvc: Candidate Chunks & Embeddings
    
    ChatSvc->>Rerank: rerank(query, candidates, top_k=5)
    Rerank->>Rerank: Compute Lexical Match & Composite Score
    Rerank-->>ChatSvc: Ranked Candidates & Quality Signal (HIGH)
    
    ChatSvc->>Gemini: generate_content(SystemRules, GroundedContextXML, Query)
    Gemini-->>ChatSvc: Synthesized Response Text
    
    ChatSvc->>Audit: log_query_event(user_id, latency, confidence, sources)
    Audit->>DB: INSERT INTO query_logs & audit_events
    DB-->>Audit: Acknowledged
    
    ChatSvc-->>Gateway: ChatResponse (answer, sources, evidence_quality)
    Gateway->>Middleware: Mask PII / Secrets in Telemetry
    Middleware-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (X-Request-ID, JSON Payload)
